  "description": "Seung-ju helps the handsome man who was fallen on the road due to a heat stroke. However, the young man who comes to his senses has amnesia. Seungju eventually brings him in at 'Dongbangmi-in', a rice cake restaurant quietly located in the alley. Even if Seung-ju is harsh and cold, he always comes to him with a bright smile. “I can't recall my memories. So let me remember using my body.\"\n\n(Source: Bookcube, translated)",
